  "details": "In UdonGraph, if you try to set a variable using another variable directly with sendChange checked, the value is never set. \nChecking the uasm generated, it never adds the copy code. This is only for value type variables (bool, int, float, vector3, etc) and not with objects.\nSee screenshots for example with the only difference being sendChange checked.",
